            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for meaning, then the Kannada for please write it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಒಂದು ನಿಮಿಷ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಂದು ನಿಮಿಷ (ondu nimiṣa) — \"one minute\". ಒಂದು is \"one\", from the numbers chapter; ನಿಮಿಷ (nimiṣa) is \"minute\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say it with a raised hand when you need a moment."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒಂದು ನಿಮಿಷ (ondu nimiṣa) is ondu, \"one\" (DEDR 990), native, and nimiṣa, \"minute\", from Sanskrit nimeṣa, \"a wink, a moment\" (CDIAL 7243). A minute is \"a blink\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A number you know and a new word for time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
