              "text": "ತೋರಿಸಿ (tōrisi) is native Dravidian: the polite command of tōrisu, \"to show\", literally \"to make appear\", from tōru, \"to appear\", which DEDR 3566 lists as Kannada tōṟu with Tamil tōṉṟu."
