              "text": "ಅರ್ಥವಾಗಲಿಲ್ಲ (arthavāgalilla) — \"I didn't understand\", literally \"the meaning did not happen\". It starts with ಅರ್ಥ, \"meaning\", from the last chapter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅರ್ಥವಾಗಲಿಲ್ಲ (arthavāgalilla) is artha, \"meaning\", from Sanskrit artha (CDIAL 638), with native āgu, \"to become\" (DEDR 333), and illa, \"not\" (DEDR 2559): \"it did not become meaning\". DEDR 333 compares Sanskrit ām."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
